  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MULTIDONOR TRUST FUND, SAFETY NET PROGRAME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PSNP 5 overall goal is to see Extreme poverty is reduced in rural Ethiopia through enhancing resilience of rural households affected by recurring climatic shocks and severe food insecurity. The program targets extreme poor (for the core caseload) and most vulnerable (for the transitory caseload) people, including persons with disabilites.&#xa0;The public works component of the PSNP puts more focus on rehabilitating degraded lands through various measures including biophysical soil and water conservation, afforestation/reforestation and gully control. This has significantly contributed to Climate Resilient Green Economic Strategy (CRGE) through the treatment of degraded lands and enhance carbon sequstration.</narrative>
  </description>
